  "description": "Joo Wooyeon, who dreams of becoming an actor, decides to give up his promiscuous lifestyle to focus on his goal.\nBut as the saying goes, old habits die hard. One drunken night, he ends up sleeping with a stranger named Kang Raon. Raon is perfect in every way - looks, personality, physique, and chemistry in bed - but there’s just one problem: he’s an eccentric who enjoys bizarre roleplay scenarios. Though the roleplay feels awkward at first, their incredible physical compatibility makes Wooyeon consider keeping things going. Then, Wooyeon learns a shocking truth: Kang Raon is actually the CEO of a film company sponsoring an independent film project at his university, and he’s just been appointed as an adjunct professor to oversee it. Determined to land the lead role in that project, Wooyeon decides to maintain his dangerous and secret relationship with Raon to gain his favor…\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10963751), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297071876), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000063878), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/professor_19_roleplaying), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240693)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10963740), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297071875), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000063877), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240694)",
